              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 19.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nama hiyyeesa isani hojattu ka gosa teesani yokhaani nama gosa d'ibi ka dira keesani keesa tau taanaani, waan inni sila isani ira argachu male d'owartani indabsina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya ch'ufa, ato aduuni ind'iine, beese guyya suni inni hojatteefi kennaafi; wonti akanatiifi inni hiyyeesa, beese suni male woma inqabu, guddo heregata. Hojja isani kennuufi baatani, inni maro teesaniifi AABBO Waaqati bohe, isanileeni wollaala argattani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
