              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaabad'a, aka isani duri lafa Misiriti tisse taatani, ammalle aka AABBO Waaqi achii isani baase: Tanaafi anini arra seera kana isanii kenna.",
          "type": "text",
